      "body": "Dear Mr. Steyer,\n\nI hope this note finds you well. As we work to protect our planet, I wanted to reach out and express my deep appreciation for your outstanding commitment to environmental advocacy, particularly your recent, significant support of environmental committees in 2024. Your leadership as a founder here in California sets a powerful example for our community.\n\nOur organization is actively driving vital solutions to these same urgent ecological challenges. Given your dedicated focus on the environment, I would love to share a brief update on our initiatives.\n\nWould you be open to a 15-minute call next week?\n\nWarm regards,\nJordan Rivera\nDevelopment Director"
